@startuml
!theme plain
title Picture 3-2 - Common Workflow Sequence\n(Upload Files -> Create Job -> Trigger Processing -> Receive Status)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ParticipantPadding 18
skinparam BoxPadding 12

actor       "User"                        as User
participant "React SPA\n(Browser)"         as FE
participant "FastAPI Backend\n(/api/...)"  as BE
database    "Database"                     as DB
entity      "File Storage\n(uploads/)"     as FS
participant "Worker / Processor"           as WK

autonumber "<b>[0]"

== 1) Upload files ==
User -> FE  : Select VCD / firmware files
FE   -> BE  : POST /api/files/upload\n(multipart)
BE   -> FS  : Save file to uploads/
BE   -> DB  : INSERT files (filename, path, checksum)
BE  --> FE  : 200 OK { file_id, checksum }
FE  --> User : Show uploaded file in library

== 2) Create job ==
User -> FE  : Fill form, click "Create Job"
FE   -> BE  : POST /api/jobs\n{ vcd_file_id, firmware_file_id, priority }
BE   -> DB  : INSERT jobs (state = PENDING)
BE  --> FE  : 201 Created { job_id }
FE  --> User : Job appears in queue (PENDING)

== 3) Trigger processing ==
User -> FE  : Click "Run"
FE   -> BE  : POST /api/jobs/{job_id}/start
BE   -> DB  : UPDATE jobs SET state = RUNNING
BE   -> WK  : dispatch(job_id)
BE  --> FE  : 202 Accepted

== 4) Processing (async) ==
WK   -> FS  : Read input files
WK   -> WK  : Execute test
WK   -> FS  : Write result artifacts
WK   -> DB  : INSERT results, UPDATE jobs SET state = COMPLETED

== 5) Receive status ==
User -> FE  : Open job detail / poll
FE   -> BE  : GET /api/jobs/{job_id}
BE   -> DB  : SELECT job + result
BE  --> FE  : 200 OK { state, result, metrics }
FE  --> User : Show status (COMPLETED / FAILED) + result link

note right of BE
  Numbers [1], [2], ... on each arrow
  correspond to the message order
  required by the report template.
end note
@enduml
